      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/QCGov/status/2020702156735815697",
      "text": "Congratulations, QC! ✨\n\nKabi-kabila ang mga parangal natatanggap ng pamahalaang Lungsod Quezon. Makakaasa kayong pagbubutihin pa ng ating lokal na pamahalaan ang paghahatid serbisyo at tutumbasan ng taos-pusong paglilingkod para sa QCitizens.\n\nPanoorin ang weekly recap na ito para sa linggo ng February 2, 2026. Makikita ang iba pang detalye sa:\n\n• QC Trash to Cashback as Manila Bulletin's Newsmaker of the year:\nhttps://t.co/sAx9epcCsx\n\n• QCU Robotics Team - VEX U Robotics Competition National Championship:\nhttps://t.co/DuQDnErgVL\n\n• BJMP’s Best at Gawad Penolohiya 4th Quarter 2025:\nhttps://t.co/5DpOgorzBn\n\n• Inauguration of the new Football Field at Amoranto Sports Complex:\nhttps://t.co/hVAmlSECFJ\n\n• Ika-93 kapistahan ni San Pedro Bautista:\nhttps://t.co/U8yElfjC7Q\n\n• Kapistahan ng Banal na Mag-Anak ng Gulod:\nhttps://t.co/LeQhXHZydn\n\n• Usapang QC Year 5: Episode 1 - Serbisyong Abot-Kamay sa QC:\nhttps://t.co/kEaBstftWp\n\n• Financial Assistance to Fire Victims - Brgy. Commonwealth, Gulod, Baesa, and Doña Aurora:\nhttps://t.co/Kv5gvFxrQr\n\n• Meeting with Landers Fairview:\nhttps://t.co/fq197h6FQe\n\n• National Shrine of Our Lady of Lourdes:\nhttps://t.co/QpuzY5HRB1\n\n• Courtesy visit of H.E. Mrs. Răduţa Dana Matache, Romanian Ambassador:\nhttps://t.co/Mog5cLSQ3q\n\n• Memorandum of Understanding with City Cancer Challenge and Philippine Cancer Society (PCS):\nhttps://t.co/q4VpSHoDaG\n\n• Cancer Screening Activity at Quezon City Hall:\nhttps://t.co/xI89Ivf3ha\n\n• Courtesy Visit of Kingspoint JOUF and DA NUPAP:\nhttps://t.co/EZ6eN8GcqU\n\n• Meeting with MMDA Chairman Don Artes, at MMDA General Manager Nicolas Torre III:\nhttps://t.co/atof6HHAQS\n\n• Courtesy visit of TESDA QC District Director:\nhttps://t.co/jXV2CjosaI\n\n#BusyQCWeeklyRecap",
